   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM demobilisering BIH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM skall genomf&#xF6;ra ett projekt f&#xF6;r att integrera frist&#xE4;llda soldater fr&#xE5;n arm&#xE9;erna i BiH i det civila samh&#xE4;llet. Detta g&#xF6;rs genom utbildningar och reintegrationsaktiviteter tillsammans med lokala f&#xF6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will conduct a project to integrate former soldiers from the BiH armies into civilian life. This is accomplished through trainings and reintegration activities in co-operation with local SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
